  "slug": "me-and-li",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/12215_me-and-li.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "Xiao Li and I are good friends and we meet often. Sometimes we eat together, sometimes we go to the store to buy things together, sometimes Xiao Li helps me learn Chinese, and sometimes I help her learn English. This Sunday, we are going to exercise together. I like playing badminton and she likes swimming. We want to play badminton first and then go swimming. Both of us will be happy."
  ],
  "english_full": "Xiao Li and I are good friends and we meet often. Sometimes we eat together, sometimes we go to the store to buy things together, sometimes Xiao Li helps me learn Chinese, and sometimes I help her learn English. This Sunday, we are going to exercise together. I like playing badminton and she likes swimming. We want to play badminton first and then go swimming. Both of us will be happy.",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "Ся́о Ли́ и я хоро́шие дру́зья́, и мы ча́сто встреча́емся. Иногда́ мы ку́шаем вме́сте, иногда́ мы идёт в магазин, чтобы покупа́ть ве́щи вместе, иногда́ Ся́о Ли́ помогает мне учи́ть кита́йский, а иногда́ я помога́ю ей учи́ть англи́йский."
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Syáo Lí i ya khoróshie drúz'ya, i my chásto vstréchayemsya. Inogdá my kúshayem vmeste, inogdá my idyot v magazín, chtoby pokupát' véshchi vmeste, inogdá Syáo Lí pomogáyet mne uchít' kitáyskiy, a inogdá ya pomogáyu yey uchít' anglíyskiy."
  ],
